 "stimulus_html": "The figure shows a map of zoo exhibits <i>A</i> through <i>P</i>. Use it to answer each question.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/5782be5c16fbdc58.png\" alt=\"A map of zoo exhibits. The vertices are labeled A to P. The entrance is at the bottom.\">\n",
